@startuml
title State diagram for Green Rides

[*] --> LoginAndSelectJourney : User logs in and selects a destination

state "LoginAndSelectJourney" as LoginAndSelectJourney
state "ViewingDetails" as ViewingDetails
state "DrivingModeActive" as DrivingModeActive
state "EatingOptions" as EatingOptions
state "AccidentReported" as AccidentReported
state "FeedbackProvided" as FeedbackProvided

LoginAndSelectJourney --> ViewingDetails : View journey details
ViewingDetails --> DrivingModeActive : Activate driving mode or choose other options
DrivingModeActive --> ViewingDetails : End driving mode and view details again
DrivingModeActive --> EatingOptions : Select a place to eat
EatingOptions --> ViewingDetails : Return to viewing journey details

ViewingDetails --> AccidentReported : Report an accident
AccidentReported --> FeedbackProvided : Provide feedback after the journey

FeedbackProvided --> [*] : End journey

@enduml
